==Description==
The '''BunnyEars Nametag''' is a nametag that could have be obtained at Level 11 of the premium [[Ducky Revenge Event#Ducky Revenge Battle Pass|Ducky Revenge Battle Pass]] track. At that Level, it had a cost of {{DuckyEggs|310}} or {{Robux|52}} ({{Robux|44}} during the Memorial Day 2025 Sale) to unlock it, with a total cost of {{DuckyEggs|1,740}} or {{Robux|662}} ({{Robux|558}} during the Memorial Day 2025 Sale).

The '''BunnyEars Nametag''' has light pink and white gradient text with a soft glow. Behind the text there is a white and pink pair of bunny ears, one upright and one tilted.

